# GLib, target cross
### Not the default build: the values of package.env this target keeps or drops
### libffi, pcre2 and zlib of the platform toolchain: not the libffi and zlib of the build host, not
### the pcre2 of the wrap of GLib, which meson fetched from the network
PKG_DEPS="lfs/libffi:cross lfs/pcre2:cross lfs/zlib:cross"
